Hyphenation patterns for Hypher
===============================

The language pattern files in this repository (patterns/*.js and the
generated dist/browser/*.js bundles) are conversions of the hyphenation
pattern files from the TeX `hyph-utf8` package
(https://www.hyphenation.org/tex). They are copyrighted to their
respective creators and maintainers and are distributed under the
license of the originating pattern file. Common licenses are:

  - GPL-2.0 (e.g. the Indonesian pattern, `patterns/id.js`)
  - LGPL
  - LPPL

Indonesian pattern (patterns/id.js)
-----------------------------------

`patterns/id.js` is derived from `hyph-id.tex` v1.3
(Copyright (C) 1996, 1997 Jörg Knappen and Terry Mart), which is
licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2.

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html

The file header in `patterns/id.js` carries the license notice of the
upstream `hyph-id.tex` file. When redistributing `patterns/id.js` or the
generated `dist/browser/id.js`, the GPL-2.0 obligations of the upstream
pattern apply.

Hypher engine
-------------

The Hypher engine (`lib/node_modules/hypher/lib/hypher.js`, installed as
a dependency of the generated npm packages) is licensed under the
BSD-3-Clause license. See `BSD.txt` in the Hypher package for details.
